OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FObservational documentary series
OL,7,     Ffilmed inside a working general
OL,8,     Fpractice, offering an honest and
OL,9,     Foften entertaining look at working
OL,10,     Fin and using the NHS in modern
OL,11,     FBritain.
OL,12,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FThe staff and patients of
OL,14,     FBarnsley's A&E department are put
OL,15,     Funder the microscope. New Junior
OL,16,     FDoctor Alex is thrown into the
OL,17,     Fmaelstrom and faces his first
OL,18,     Fpatient.
